//! The `writing-mode` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets whether
//! lines of text are laid out horizontally or vertically, as well as the direction in which text
//! flows.
//!
//! Initial: horizontal-tb. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
